WEBVTT

00:16.058 --> 00:19.461
A tick tock goes a plastic clock. Another

00:19.481 --> 00:22.083
meeting on another block. They're selling me a

00:22.103 --> 00:25.165
future that I don't want. It's just the same old

00:25.225 --> 00:28.488
tired song. I'm out of patience. I'm out of time.

00:28.848 --> 00:31.070
This ain't your product. This life ain't mine.

00:31.590 --> 00:34.953
Out of patience. Out of time. Gonna break free.

00:36.214 --> 00:37.395
Gonna cross the line.

